invariant: INV-17
file: poly1305_vector.c
catches: poly1305_equiv_test
reason: the vector Poly1305 returns without wiping r^2, r^3 and r^4, so
  its dead frame keeps them. r and a tag seen on the wire give the pad,
  and r and the pad forge any message under that key. Every tag is still
  right, so no vector sees it. bin/poly1305_equiv_test copies the stack
  below a call and looks for each power as the call lays it out.

--- old
    carry_scalar(p->h, total);
    ct_wipe(&of_r, sizeof of_r);
--- new
    carry_scalar(p->h, total);
